------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 [Pose(POINT Z (2 3 3),0.988771,0,0,0.149438)@Mon Jan 01 00:00:00 2001 PST, Pose(POINT Z (4 4 3),0.852525,0,0,0.522687)@Tue Jan 02 00:00:00 2001 PST]
(1 row)

