----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 [Pose(POINT Z (1 0.764842 0.644218),0.928825,0.339047,-0.051242,0.140378)@Mon Jan 01 00:00:00 2001 PST, Pose(POINT Z (3 1.529684 1.288435),0.800838,0.292329,-0.179228,0.490998)@Tue Jan 02 00:00:00 2001 PST]
